{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39763","headline":"题宣一僧正院 · 黄滔","name":"题宣一僧正院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五级凌虚塔，三生落发师。\n都僧须有托，孤峤遂无期。\n井邑焚香待，君侯减俸资。\n山衣随叠破，莱骨逐年羸。\n茶取寒泉试，松於远涧移。\n吾曹来顶手，不合不题诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39763.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39763","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}